    "date": "2026-09-03T15:46:13Z",
    "text": "Geriatrics Workforce Improvement Act\n\nThis bill reauthorizes through FY2030 (1) the Geriatrics Workforce Enhancement Program, which provides grants to educate and train health professionals to care for older adults; and (2) the Geriatrics Academic Career Awards, which support the career development of junior faculty at health professions institutions who provide training in geriatrics. These programs are administered by the Health Resources and Services Administration."
  },
